Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.23,0:09:07.94,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fnFZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\fs35\c&H29EFEE&\3c&H443B43&\bord5\frz29.85\pos(77.6,372.4)}快看这里
